{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e812e9916edcffbf989a6da0aeb8b90227cf5a43f7c9923cfda99bd6d382415d", "ja": "（そろそろ次の公演のことを決めないとな。\nさて、ここはそろそろ……）", "zh": "（差不多该决定下一场公演的事了。\n那么，这里也差不多该……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "73f9f708564d6489a0b599c5a265028e0af21700df65de3b28ea08ea47fe2676", "ja": "あっ、仕掛け人さま！\n仕掛け人さまも、素晴らしかったと思いますよね！？", "zh": "啊，筹谋者大人！\n筹谋者大人也觉得非常棒对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1002_p", "source_sha256": "063151bedcc756395d128bcf923276946dcbdedbb850975a85d7409bc01b0948", "ja": "うん？　えーと……なんの話だ？", "zh": "嗯？呃……你在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "3353144438b1484fbe400baf10106f3893a2a794fd198d7acadb1b5c80ad3e3e", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。私たちは\n今、貴音さんの野外ライブの話をしていました。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。我们刚才正在聊贵音小姐的户外演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "9c658d6c5978f7338741bbcef5455dacd8f2b87649d4fbd4190dafbda0d202ec", "ja": "誰もが貴音さんに魅入られた、素敵なステージ……\nと、思い出すだけで……。うっとり。", "zh": "所有人都被貴音小姐深深吸引的精彩舞台……光是回想起来，就……陶醉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1005_p", "source_sha256": "61e9aee81f2e15dfad4aacf5bde304054dd51b7877fe6c659e9fbc60a5e8c1b9", "ja": "ああ、この間のか。そうだな、貴音のステージは\n俺も楽しみにしてたけど……期待以上だったよ。", "zh": "啊，是前阵子的那场啊。确实，我也很期待贵音的舞台，不过……真是超出预期了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "f974202084406b9f86e62842b98d99b25f051c95aaf1eb8d1a10aed61e90b26d", "ja": "ふふっ、{$P$}まで……。\n何とも面映ゆいことです。", "zh": "呵呵，连{$P$}都……真是让人不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "24ac84d6fe1c0c54f940cfdacc502dcd4cae99fe9c9f810ec0f0a28774406922", "ja": "ですが、そのように言っていただけると\nなおのこと、明日への意欲が湧いてまいりますね。", "zh": "不过，您能这样对我说，\n反而更让我涌起迎接明日的干劲呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "d715b19fedc9adb809d9cdc28c98b21b00c823343df1b7c895393f554a792da4", "ja": "{$P$}。お忙しいと思いますが、\n次の舞台の手配、よろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "{$P$}。您应该很忙，还请安排好下一场演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9fedfc244c8bc260843a9bc6ba22d4113df086616bf97e490c617ced0564964d", "ja": "もちろん、任せてくれ。\nというわけで、手配しにきたぞ！", "zh": "当然，交给我吧。\n所以，我来安排下一场演出了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "2f877038dba1041675a68f24cb6cef4e50f3d9c2b7f3ddd329ee2666a6e2ed5b", "ja": "……はて？　手配しにきたぞ、とは……？", "zh": "……哎呀？特地来安排，是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "77b75d83e46a3255411df41288a3213c576b2ead5100469186880442741e1ad0", "ja": "はっ！　読めました。今のは、つまり……\n『四条貴音センター公演』開催のお知らせですね？", "zh": "啊！我读懂了。也就是说，刚才那是……\n“四条贵音中心公演”举办通知，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "631c43967fe22209ef7ee0be640dd14e0f1165bc25af61cec73c279aec3fb658", "ja": "貴音さまの……主役公演……！\n本当ですか、仕掛け人さま！？", "zh": "贵音大人的……主角公演……！\n真的吗，制作人大人！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1013_p", "source_sha256": "57d6e232d7e564cd1b4ef97eb11a3b3eb55d9636adf63c499eb0d30e9acacb60", "ja": "本当だよエミリー。瑞希、正解だ。次の劇場公演は、\n貴音に任せたいと思ってるんだけど……、どうだ？", "zh": "是真的，艾米莉。瑞希，说对了。下一场剧场公演，我想交给贵音来负责……你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "4e9f1b760ca236f415f70c1b57efecc62529a7d708500532402d0effba5de456", "ja": "なんと、そうでしたか……。\nこの劇場のセンターに、私を……。", "zh": "竟然是这样吗……。\n要让我担任这座剧场的中心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "65d1efce95e1611fa9d48df729d5cd74b0009551b48d25462a2686a88e7a6f61", "ja": "いえ……光栄なことです。\nもちろん、喜んでお引き受けいたします。", "zh": "不……这是我的荣幸。\n我当然愿意接受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "1f3d91860733e4635ee580f6f939fb314a632d5541f5f77a17cfa1e0d9b6e016", "ja": "Wow！　仕掛け人さま、ありがとうございます！\n貴音さまの主役公演……はああ、楽しみでしゅ～♪", "zh": "Wow！制作人大人，谢谢您！\n贵音大人的主演公演……啊啊，好期待呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "c3ea7f9c09547b9a6f85df3d691347d274dc3d375bfa9f7389a09879815ca547", "ja": "{$P$}、公演のサポートは、私に\nお任せください。貴音さんの魅力、学んでみせます。", "zh": "{$P$}，演出的支持就请交给我吧。贵音小姐的魅力，我一定会好好学习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "1e842fd6b5f5aa9876d9091ebaeb1d00537ced73e46c117fe315725a0833b351", "ja": "はっ！　あ、あの仕掛け人さま、私もですっ。\n私も貴音さまのお手伝いがしたいですっ！", "zh": "哈！那、那个制作人先生，我也要参加！我也想帮助贵音大人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "ebb2ccbdd44c40966b689b9d104469ccbbef24307a3cdd5255ce4ff9f133f165", "ja": "あっ。で、でも……\nご、ご迷惑……でしょうか……？", "zh": "啊。可、可是……\n会、会不会给您添麻烦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1020_p", "source_sha256": "34c78d37d612e813db5883a2779a063be851864e7c9c0d8fec9014239fc0f359", "ja": "そんなことないと思うよ。\nどうだ、貴音？", "zh": "我觉得不是那样哦。\n怎么样，贵音？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "781cac8f55b5d7787375ab9f7cde1ad31193cef984ffa4ae144baaec3c32f1e4", "ja": "これほど心強いことはありません。\nエミリー、瑞希。頼りにしていますね。", "zh": "没有比这更让人安心的了。\n艾米莉、瑞希，就拜托你们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "a88d3666dc6c0918d18368c3765ffbd7476df344824d3f64c0609d71a14a2347", "ja": "貴音さま……！\nありがとうございますっ♪　私、全力で頑張りますね！", "zh": "贵音大人……！谢谢您♪我会竭尽全力努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "d7a3e365a96a471fb63b9e57049d2c99ee5005233e1a3dd7e67a739fa2b14f68", "ja": "はい。背中は任せてください。\n……目指すぞ、ミステリアスビューティ。", "zh": "好的。后背就交给我吧。\n……目标是神秘美人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_051_1024_p", "source_sha256": "75a4d68887f6dbb9831cfd73ea31ff6de0801b35206d6b539e4924f9bb2b2943", "ja": "（本人以上に周りが燃えている気もするが……\nそんな貴音の魅力、公演でしっかり伝えていこう！）", "zh": "（感觉周围的人比本人还要热血沸腾……不过，贵音的魅力，就在公演中好好传达给大家吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
